<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body>
    <main>
      <article>
        <h1>Piecewise linear networks divide input space into regions</h1>
        <p>The number and arrangement of these regions describe the functions represented by the network.</p>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/linear_regions.svg" alt="plot">
          <figcaption>Figure 1. Linear regions along a one dimensional input</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/activation_folding.svg" alt="Activation space folding">
        </figure>
        <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNk+A8AAQUBAScY42YAAAAASUVORK5CYII=" alt="">
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
